+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "e13f4403b39f42c886894399b5b47a09",
+    "seq": 21,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 24,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:06:58.484046+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 6,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "门被推开，阿青走进来，一边收起还在滴水的伞。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "ee5af6d7f2404c6b83fbfb2d81d08766",
+    "seq": 22,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 25,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:06:58.866110+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 7,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "雨下大了。你怎么还没睡？",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "4474718071ab4ddeb35880c60a58df9e",
+    "seq": 23,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 26,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:00.218112+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 8,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "阿青……这个，好像坏了。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "4cfda89ee88648cca040163d0022169f",
+    "seq": 24,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 27,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:02.382600+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 9,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "阿青接过录音笔，翻来覆去地看了一遍。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "69f2105401d8402c99d6406237c9dc54",
+    "seq": 25,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 28,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:03.103423+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 10,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "播放键没反应？",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "710b5cef2bbc4d32b9199f31b6c66541",
+    "seq": 26,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 29,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:05.199877+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 11,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "嗯。按了好多次，只有杂音。这是从别人那里借来的……会不会是我不小心弄坏的？",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "15db52c7f2124544a16e0472f54209c8",
+    "seq": 27,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 30,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:06.844783+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 12,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "阿青没有立刻回答，把录音笔凑近耳边，轻轻晃了晃。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "e438a826498c474f93c227f8ae5b4dbc",
+    "seq": 28,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 31,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:08.467105+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 13,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "不像是摔的。可能是接触问题。我可以拆开看看。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "e5d7b21ea7624348a463a27e9080df17",
+    "seq": 29,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 32,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:10.229545+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 14,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "你觉得……我们要不要先告诉物主？这样瞒着修，万一更坏了怎么办？",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "b005ea3dadfe45f788b9089ceed7ce8c",
+    "seq": 30,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 33,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:11.745032+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 15,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "阿青放下录音笔，看向小墨。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "29475ceae3114805808b644f5a860868",
+    "seq": 31,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 34,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:13.391542+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 16,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "先看看能不能修好。知道具体坏在哪里，告诉人家的时候也说得清楚。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "790ba45446184a558a4dae218e588651",
+    "seq": 32,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 35,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:14.894182+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 17,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "那……小心一点。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "20da00cba043406b8986af8bce01fedc",
+    "seq": 33,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 36,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:17.563312+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 18,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "阿青从抽屉里拿出小螺丝刀，在灯下开始拧开录音笔的背板。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "0430d050ab404eeb889791c2f2585c0c",
+    "seq": 34,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 37,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:19.214612+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 19,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "这机器有些年头了。谁借给你的？",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "cf59251f42cd440184cca32d56fc397c",
+    "seq": 35,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 38,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:20.883985+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 20,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "一个……之前一起做声音采集的朋友。他说这支笔录过很多珍贵的东西。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "94e3186dd88647c69a9e4601da474e9d",
+    "seq": 36,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 39,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:24.062254+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 21,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "阿青的手顿了顿，然后继续用工具轻轻拨开内部的一个小卡扣。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "7c8bca069401449792d1692451cef435",
+    "seq": 37,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 40,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:24.072676+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 22,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "难怪你这么紧张。别担心，只是个小问题。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "5220694ce2bd4da8a7a8622ae45abf76",
+    "seq": 38,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 41,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:26.279794+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "a22722dfdda4414991cf7dacda7e9895",
+      "chunk_index": 23,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "雨声渐缓，只剩下偶尔的滴答。台灯下，两个人影凑在一起，围着那支被拆开的录音笔。",
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "3ce687875f2e4caba2a4053bb48e6881",
+    "seq": 39,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 45,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.ready",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:07:51.756709+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "scene_key": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f",
+      "scene": {
+        "scene_id": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f",
+        "scene_index": 1,
+        "title": "雨夜故障",
+        "location": "小墨的房间",
+        "dramatic_goal": "小墨发现录音笔坏了，向阿青求助，两人面对意外状况。",
+        "utterances": [
+          {
+            "line_id": "aeb5f5b10f7f4b5e9c4d1d964fd1624f-l1",
+            "kind": "narration",
+            "speaker_role_id": null,
+            "narrator_id": "narrator",
+            "performer_id": "narrator",
+            "text": "窗外的雨声淅淅沥沥，敲打着玻璃。屋内，台灯的光圈拢着桌上散落的录音设备和笔记本。",
+            "emotion": "calm",
+            "tone_instruction": "气息平稳，用中低音铺开画面，句尾略收，留出不安的余味",
+            "emphasis": [
+              {
+                "span_text": "淅淅沥沥",
+                "occurrence": 1,
+                "start_char": 5,
+                "end_char": 9,
+                "strength": "medium"
+              },
+              {
