+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 6,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "不会。这种小活我常干。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "b784dd1eb34a4ad085cda2fb264f024e",
+    "seq": 48,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 55,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:06.690473+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 7,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "细小的松香味散开，焊锡轻轻融化又凝固。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "ed79ad9040d74e7785acec24377b6f91",
+    "seq": 49,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 56,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:08.375722+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 8,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "当初借的时候，她跟我说里面录了她外婆唱的歌。就这一份。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "3b8c93aad715498e8f10790c6f7b268e",
+    "seq": 50,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 57,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:09.645688+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 9,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "所以你这么着急。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "665d8684caed40dcb3ee0c1f04769413",
+    "seq": 51,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 58,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:11.714551+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 10,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "小墨点了点头，把桌上的一把镊子递给阿青。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "341f94f09c454f46a1ed9bb41c3cf7cf",
+    "seq": 52,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 59,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:12.365135+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 11,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "修好之后，我们得告诉她。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "bf92ce05f1244356a3a1816d97b2b842",
+    "seq": 53,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 60,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:14.018717+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 12,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "你觉得……她会生气吗？",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "5356c42ceb64465ba1eaf14f8f6c0a1f",
+    "seq": 54,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 61,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:16.135207+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 13,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "可能。但修好了不说，才是真的辜负她的信任。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "8cd3fab087094513ad659a0f2b989333",
+    "seq": 55,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 62,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:17.117757+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 14,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "小墨沉默了几秒，然后深吸一口气。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "bb8cf5c26c854fde91bd9cad564c8508",
+    "seq": 56,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 63,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:18.907193+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 15,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "你说得对。不能因为修好了，就当没发生过。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "458f558b8d2f4f24a45f3176c625834f",
+    "seq": 57,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 64,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:20.512354+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 16,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "阿青将最后一个外壳卡扣合上，发出清脆的“咔哒”声。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "25a876ce48e14e089b1ebbdcdba1cef4",
+    "seq": 58,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 65,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:21.213057+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 17,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "好了。试试。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "d5a9759deb2b497391e865290b7085a3",
+    "seq": 59,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 66,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:26.555477+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 18,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "小墨的手指悬在播放键上，犹豫了一下，然后轻轻按下。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "1f882fbfa37a426c981e09ecc245e0a4",
+    "seq": 60,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 67,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:26.578653+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 19,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "录音笔的指示灯亮起，先是一阵轻微的电流底噪，然后传出一段模糊而悠远的老歌片段。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "f178ef6de0144d848f7a31b61903b516",
+    "seq": 61,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 68,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:26.600712+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 20,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "小墨的眼睛亮了起来，脸上露出今晚第一个真正的笑容。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "ed0d60fb9feb45fdb70c9a9fb181d141",
+    "seq": 62,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 69,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:26.616865+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 21,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "是外婆的声音……没丢。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "f7e81d3536ef440795f83db18997a349",
+    "seq": 63,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 70,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:27.784824+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 22,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "阿青靠在椅背上，松了一口气，嘴角微微上扬。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "683686e3d9ac49a5ac6cc169bbac83dc",
+    "seq": 64,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 71,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:28.926540+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 23,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "明天，我陪你去。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "c0bef0a08b834109912d3c82a3a3054f",
+    "seq": 65,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 72,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:30.556723+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 24,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "小墨关掉录音笔，小心地把它握在手里，然后用力点了点头。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "aa09a3a44c5e4615b12c97e9787c0a69",
+    "seq": 66,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 73,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:31.412756+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 25,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "嗯。我们一起。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "7d53a13d77ca4a14ace6c0b631550f63",
+    "seq": 67,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 74,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.text.delta",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:33.437803+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "attempt_id": "0a30452767d54537bc5d5d4883cc98bb",
+      "chunk_index": 26,
+      "field": "text",
+      "text": "雨停了。窗外的夜色变得清澈，屋内的灯光笼罩着桌上那些被修复的零件，和两个不再需要独自承担秘密的人。",
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "event_id": "4d2c75acf8964bcc8f1bdb3f68fd1e9d",
+    "seq": 68,
+    "session_id": "83c13e514d0c411a8b33fa7a9e5b767b",
+    "revision": 78,
+    "generation_epoch": 1,
+    "type": "scene.ready",
+    "occurred_at": "2026-11-11T09:08:57.088526+00:00",
+    "payload": {
+      "scene_key": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5",
+      "scene": {
+        "scene_id": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5",
+        "scene_index": 2,
+        "title": "修理与坦白",
+        "location": "小墨的房间",
+        "dramatic_goal": "阿青修好录音笔，两人决定一起向物主说明情况。",
+        "utterances": [
+          {
+            "line_id": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5-l1",
+            "kind": "narration",
+            "speaker_role_id": null,
+            "narrator_id": "narrator",
+            "performer_id": "narrator",
+            "text": "窗外的雨声渐渐小了。桌面上，录音笔被拆开，零件按照顺序整齐地排在一块软布上。",
+            "emotion": "calm",
+            "tone_instruction": "以平稳叙述起句，语速略放慢，像镜头缓缓推进",
+            "emphasis": [
+              {
+                "span_text": "渐渐小了",
+                "occurrence": 1,
+                "start_char": 5,
+                "end_char": 9,
+                "strength": "medium"
+              },
+              {
+                "span_text": "整齐地排",
+                "occurrence": 1,
+                "start_char": 27,
+                "end_char": 31,
+                "strength": "medium"
+              }
+            ],
+            "speech_rate": 0.92,
+            "pitch": null,
+            "volume": null,
+            "pauses": [],
+            "delivery_note": "句间留半拍气口；‘软布上’尾音收轻，给下一句对话留空间。",
+            "audio_cue_ref": null
+          },
+          {
+            "line_id": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5-l2",
+            "kind": "dialogue",
+            "speaker_role_id": "qing",
+            "narrator_id": null,
+            "performer_id": "performer-qing",
+            "text": "找到了。这个焊点松了，接触不良。",
+            "emotion": "serious",
+            "tone_instruction": "压低嗓音但咬字清楚，前半句像确认结果，后半句像陈述判断",
+            "emphasis": [
+              {
+                "span_text": "找到了",
+                "occurrence": 1,
+                "start_char": 0,
+                "end_char": 3,
+                "strength": "strong"
+              },
+              {
+                "span_text": "焊点松了",
+                "occurrence": 1,
+                "start_char": 6,
+                "end_char": 10,
+                "strength": "medium"
+              }
+            ],
+            "speech_rate": 0.95,
+            "pitch": null,
+            "volume": null,
+            "pauses": [],
+            "delivery_note": "专注地看着手里的元件，语气平静但确定；‘找到了’后停顿约半秒，再说故障原因；尾字不拖。",
+            "audio_cue_ref": null
+          },
+          {
+            "line_id": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5-l3",
+            "kind": "sfx",
+            "speaker_role_id": null,
+            "narrator_id": null,
+            "performer_id": "narrator",
+            "text": "阿青拿起电烙铁，轻微的电流声响起。",
+            "emotion": null,
+            "tone_instruction": null,
+            "emphasis": [],
+            "speech_rate": 1.0,
+            "pitch": null,
+            "volume": null,
+            "pauses": [],
+            "delivery_note": null,
+            "audio_cue_ref": null
+          },
+          {
+            "line_id": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5-l4",
+            "kind": "dialogue",
+            "speaker_role_id": "mo",
+            "narrator_id": null,
+            "performer_id": "performer-mo",
+            "text": "阿青，你手稳一点……会不会烫到旁边的零件？",
+            "emotion": "worried",
+            "tone_instruction": "气声偏多、音量放轻，劝告里带一点不确定的上扬",
+            "emphasis": [
+              {
+                "span_text": "手稳一点",
+                "occurrence": 1,
+                "start_char": 4,
+                "end_char": 8,
+                "strength": "medium"
+              },
+              {
+                "span_text": "烫到",
+                "occurrence": 1,
+                "start_char": 13,
+                "end_char": 15,
+                "strength": "strong"
+              }
+            ],
+            "speech_rate": 0.9,
+            "pitch": null,
+            "volume": null,
+            "pauses": [],
+            "delivery_note": "声音轻柔，带着一丝紧张，身体微微前倾；‘阿青’轻唤；省略号处明显停顿，问句尾音不要飘太高。",
+            "audio_cue_ref": null
+          },
+          {
+            "line_id": "3d904ed287914525b4e4c01e4a06dca5-l5",
+            "kind": "dialogue",
+            "speaker_role_id": "qing",
+            "narrator_id": null,
+            "performer_id": "performer-qing",
+            "text": "不会。这种小活我常干。",
+            "emotion": "calm",
+            "tone_instruction": "短促利落，像手上活没停，不带多余情绪",
+            "emphasis": [
+              {
+                "span_text": "不会",
+                "occurrence": 1,
+                "start_char": 0,
+                "end_char": 2,
+                "strength": "strong"
+              },
+              {
+                "span_text": "常干",
+                "occurrence": 1,
+                "start_char": 8,
+                "end_char": 10,
+                "strength": "medium"
+              }
+            ],
+            "speech_rate": 1.05,
+            "pitch": null,
